  "abstract": "Covers the OpenVEX specification from the openvex/spec repository: VEX documents and statements, the product, component and vulnerability structs, the four status labels and five not_affected justifications, inheritance and document updates, the JSON Schema and JSON-LD context, embedding as an in-toto attestation predicate, and the mapping to the CISA Minimum Requirements for VEX. It lists two version lines: OpenVEX v0.2.0 (current, pinned to the v0.2.0 release and the main-branch text at commit 61b5f88) and OpenVEX v0.0.2 (legacy, upgraded from); no newer draft exists. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions and upgrades, the document and statement model, status and justifications, and producing and consuming.",
